OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,FThe new Mayor of Greater Manchester
OL,7,FBev Craig has announced free bus
OL,8,Ftravel for 11-18 year olds on her
OL,9,Ffirst day in the job.
OL,11,FMs Craig has confirmed the extension
OL,12,Fof 'Our Pass', which already gives 16-
OL,13,F18 year olds free bus travel will take
OL,14,Feffect from January 2027.
OL,16,FUp to 200,000 young people are
OL,17,Fexpected to benefit, in a move which
OL,18,Fcould save families up to #500 a year
OL,19,Fper child.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
