OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,FThe former Manchester City Council
OL,7,Fleader was elected on Friday 31 July
OL,8,Fafter winning the election with 47.15%
OL,9,Fof the vote count. She replaces her
OL,10,Ffriend and now Prime Minister Andy
OL,11,FBurnham.
OL,13,FShe said it will help to make getting
OL,14,Fto education, training and
OL,15,Fopportunities easier for young people.
OL,16,FThe Mayor has also revealed dates for
OL,17,Fnew Bee Network bus routes and night
OL,18,Fbuses.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,FBev Craig said: "I stood on a platform
OL,7,Fbefore I was elected saying that I
OL,8,Fwanted to help people with the cost-of-
OL,9,Fliving crisis, build out the Bee
OL,10,FNetwork and make a difference for our
OL,11,Fyoung people.
OL,13,F"So on day one, my announcement, free
OL,14,Fbus passes for every 11 to 18 year old
OL,15,Facross Greater Manchester puts #500 in
OL,16,Fthe pockets of families and from
OL,17,FJanuary 2027 gives a message to our
OL,18,Fyoung people that they can go wherever
OL,19,Fthey want to in life."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,FMs Craig explained that the changes
OL,7,Fare fully costed and paid for using
OL,8,F"existing budgets".
OL,10,FShe said: "In my manifesto I didn't
OL,11,Fmake promises that I couldn't deliver,
OL,12,Fso I'd already done a lot of the work
OL,13,Fon how much it would cost.
OL,15,F"So we're going to pay for this using
OL,16,Fexisting budgets. This isn't going to
OL,17,Fbe extra taxpayers' money that hasn't
OL,18,Fbeen forecast.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,F"We're going to use our single
OL,7,Fsettlement that we've got, the funding
OL,8,Fstreams we have, and in getting more
OL,9,Fyoung people on the buses, encourage
OL,10,Ftheir families to get on the bus too,
OL,11,Fand over time grow the Bee Network.
OL,13,FMs Craig said she has "taken
OL,14,Flearnings" from free bus travel for 16-
OL,15,F18 year-olds, and used that when
OL,16,Fmapping out the expanded plans.
OL,18,F"Some people were worried about anti-
OL,19,Fsocial behaviour, for example, but we
OL,20,Fdidn't see that with 16 to 18 year
OL,21,Folds," she said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785779366
OL,3,CMayor announces free bus travel for 11-
OL,4,C18 year olds across Greater Manchester
OL,6,F"We're working with Greater Manchester
OL,7,FPolice (GMP) and Transport for Greater
OL,8,FManchester (TfGM), and working with
OL,9,Fbus drivers, and we'll get all of that
OL,10,Fwork done before January, which is why
OL,11,Fwe're taking the time to implement it.
OL,13,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,14,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,15,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,16,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
